  "ingredients": [
    "1 lemon, quartered",
    "2 large artichokes",
    "0.75 cup olive oil",
    "4 cloves garlic, chopped",
    "1 teaspoon salt",
    "0.5 teaspoon ground black pepper"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather the ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/EM1rgvxyctnr5VXE7a864HfZAVI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/Grilled-Arttichokes-step-01-202-ac6a2eb372694594adfc56e942b5520f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/57899/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Fill a large bowl with cold water. Squeeze juice from one lemon wedge into the water. Trim tops and stems from artichokes, cut in half lengthwise, and use a spoon to scoop out the fuzzy choke. Place artichoke halves in the lemon water to prevent browning.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/zOqrLkoBKtv3wS2hcSA2TReiPYU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/Grilled-Arttichokes-step-02-203-ce40a602ff58450cacec8fc2a51351e3.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/57899/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bring a large pot of water to a boil. Add artichokes to boiling water, and cook until tender, about 15 minutes. Drain. Meanwhile, preheat an outdoor grill for medium-high heat.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/w5lJbXULmckUMYjC4Hp2Ku-F_T4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/Grilled-Arttichokes-step-03-211-7efc875551e8410a99f092071167e38d.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/57899/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "To make the basting and dipping sauce: Squeeze remaining lemon wedges into a medium bowl; stir in olive oil and garlic, and season with salt and pepper.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/pcxiy5wZvU7psDo17P4zapGLcqc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/Grilled-Arttichokes-step-04-210-31c1e214f5854f6189f26c3e8dfe265a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/57899/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Brush artichokes with a coating of lemon-garlic dipping sauce; place on the preheated grill and cook, basting with sauce and turning frequently, until the tips are a little charred, 5 to 10 minutes. Serve immediately with remaining lemon-garlic sauce.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/5ZsZ-yP1XSKaEc9nJEs_ru-wgxM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/Grilled-Arttichokes-step-05-215-71bd2f0e691a4b63bf0ed3c3800f5ca2.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/57899/step_05.webp"
    }
  ],
